cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below, together with the spectrafit-core release it reproduces."
title: "SpectraFit-Core-Reproducibility: every published result of spectrafit-core, regenerated from the release"
abstract: >-
  A pinned, thin consumer of the spectrafit-core release that regenerates the
  NIST StRD agreement tables, the figures and the timing comparison reported in
  the SoftwareX article on spectrafit-core, on a recorded host, and checks every
  number stated in the text against the regenerated data. The timing benchmark
  (160 cases, six backends, five repetition depths, 50 catalogue seeds) was
  measured on that host with the published 0.1.2 wheel and release harness.
